%
O00100 (SIMPLE PROBE-BORE-AND-ADJUST-TOOL MACRO) 
(10.1.18 MRT) 

M00
(THIS IS A MACRO EXERCIZE, FOR REFERENCE ONLY)


(*** THIS MACRO WILL: ***)
(-FINISH MILL 1.3IN BORE)
(-PROBE BORE)
(-ALARM IF BORE TOO BIG) 
(-ADJUST TOOL WEAR IF BORE SMALL)
(-COMPLETE NORMALLY, M30)
(*** END MACRO DESCRIPTION ***)

(*** VARIABLE DEFINITIONS ***)
(#100 = TARGET BORE DIAMETER)
(#101 = CALCULATED T WEAR DEVIATION FROM TARGET)
(#188 = PROBED DIAMETER)
(#2606= TOOL DIAMETER WEAR, TOOL 6)
(*** END VARIABLE DEFINITIONS ***)

(*** OFFSETS, TOOLS ***)
(G54 XY WORK OFFSET IS CENTER OF 1.3IN BORE)
(G54 Z IS TOP OF FINISHED PART) 
(T6 = .5IN BN EM, MILLS BORE)
(T25 = PROBE)
(*** END OFFSETS ***)

G20 (CHECK FOR INCH MODE)

M97 P1000 (FINISH 1.3IN BORE) 

G103 P1 (BLOCK LOOKAHEAD) 

M97 P2000 (PROBE BORE) 

(TARGET BORE DIA. IS 1.3" +/-.001")
#100=1.3 (ENTER TARGET DIAMETER HERE)

(IF PROBED BORE DIA. IS TOO BIG, JUMP TO LINE 3000)
IF [ #188 GT [#100+.001] ] GOTO3000 (ALARM) 

(STORE NEEDED TOOL WEAR ADJUSTMENT IN VAR. #101)
#101= #100 - #188 (TARGET-PROBED BORE DIA. DEVIATION) 

(ADJUST T6 TOOL WEAR OFFSET)
#2606= #2606 - #101 (ADJUST WEAR OFFSET) 

G103 
M30 (END PROGRAM) 

(ALL SUBS BELOW, AFTER M30)

N1000 (FINISH 1.3IN BORE, SUB) 
T6 M06 (.5 ENDMILL) 
S8500 M03 
G54 G00 G90 X.2093 Y-.0344
G43 Z.1 H06 M08
G01 Z-.8 F200.
G41 X.2906 Y.024D06 F30.
G03 X.3249 Y.2333 I-.0875 J.1218
X.2571 Y.3064 I-.3249 J-.2333
I-.2571 J-.3064
X.0458 Y.2879 I-.0964 J-.1149
G40 G01 X-.0185 Y.2113
G00 Z.1 M09
M99 

N2000 (PROBE BORE) 
M06 T25 (PROBE) 
G103 P1
G54 G00 G90 X0. Y0. 
G43 H25 Z4. 
G65 P9832                   (PROBE ON)                
G65 P9810 Z-0.4 F120.(PROTECTED MOVE)   
G65 P9814 D1.3           (PROBE FEATURE)     
G65 P9810 Z4. F200.   (PROTECTED MOVE)   
G65 P9833                   (PROBE OFF)  
M99 

N3000 (ALARM SUB) 
#3000= 1 (BORE TOO LARGE, PART BAD) 
M99 

%